several serious obstacles that may hold back players, but in the eyes of viewers, those obstacles look not that serious...well, they look so easy peasy lemon squeezy! Viewers might scream, &quot;What an idiot! Why die there!&quot;<br><br>Never be afraid of trying this game! Even my mother cleared all stages after hundreds of times of trial. <br><br>Give this game as a gift to your friends or favorite streamers!",
